  "new_commit_message": "ref(skills): Streamline commit and PR writing guidance (#160)\n\nThe commit and `pr-writer` skills now concentrate runtime guidance on\nthe\ndecisions agents need while committing or preparing review. Commit\nguidance\nretains branch protection, conventional formatting, privacy, and footer\nrules\nin 62 lines. PR guidance consolidates full-diff inspection, title and\nbody\nselection, optional reviewer aids, safety boundaries, and create/update\ncommands in 160 lines.\n\nAgent attribution requirements are removed from the repository policy\nand the\nmatching PR spec and eval. PR inspection now handles both existing and\nfirst-time PRs, expands `$BASE` correctly, and uses body-file commands\ninstead\nof embedded heredocs.",
